## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- WMA5: iMA(NULL,0,5,0,MODE_LWMA,PRICE_CLOSE,0)
- SMA11: iMA(NULL,0,11,0,MODE_SMA,PRICE_CLOSE,0)
- PSAR(0.01,0.1): iSAR(NULL,0,0.01,0.1,0) — source shows (0.1,0.01) but convention is (step,max); use (0.01,0.1)
- ADX DI+: iADX(NULL,0,14,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_PLUSDI,0); DI−: MODE_MINUSDI
- Exit: PSAR flips from below to above price = close LONG
- SL: swing low for LONG — iLow(NULL,0,iLowest(NULL,0,MODE_LOW,20,1))
- P3 sweeps: PSAR parameters (0.01/0.1 vs 0.02/0.2), WMA/SMA periods (5/11 vs 5/20)

